error[type-mismatch] 2:22-2:23
  (filter (fn [x] (> x 0)) [1.5 -2.5])
                       ^
  > takes two Ints or two Floats, but this is an Int and the other operand is a Float.
  Expected: Float
  Found: Int
  Sx does not convert between number types. (float n) turns an Int into a Float.
  Fix: (float 0)
  Help: sx help float
